!
! Calculation of molecular oxygen using unrestricted single reference CC
! Calculation done in D2h symmetry
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Moelcular oxygen. Ground state.
.WAVE F
**HAMILTONIAN
.LVCORR
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
 6 8
.OPEN SHELL
1
2/4,0
*END OF

 &RELCCSD NELEC_F1=2,3,1,0 NELEC_F2=2,2,1,1 &END

